# ==============================================================================
# ORBWEBS / USWORK.NET — ZERO-LEAK EXCLUSION MATRIX
# L1 PREVENTIVE STAGING DEFENSE (DEFENSE-IN-DEPTH LAYER 1)
# ==============================================================================
# NON-BYPASS LIMITATIONS:
# 1. This file is a PREVENTIVE CONTROL at the local staging index (git add).
# 2. It does NOT retroactively un-track previously committed objects.
# 3. It does NOT inspect internal file content for committed credentials.
# 4. It can be bypassed via forced commands (git add -f).
# 5. Must be coupled with L2 Pre-commit hooks and L3 GitHub Push Protection.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SECRETS, ENCRYPTION KEYS & CERTIFICATES
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.pkcs12
*.p12
*.pfx
*.asc
*.gpg
*.crt
*.csr
*.der
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
id_ecdsa
id_ecdsa.pub
id_ed25519
id_ed25519.pub
*.keystore
*.jks
AuthKey_*.p8

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATIONS & RUNTIME SECRETS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
!.env.sample
*.env
*.local.env

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. CLOUD PROVIDER CREDENTIALS & INFRASTRUCTURE AS CODE
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.aws/
.gcp/
.azure/
credentials
